  /Subject (UQFF whitepaper: PAPER_2087_ROUND_212_CP2_PENTAD_BACKBONE_FIRST_UQFF) /Title (Round 212 CP2 Pentad Discovery + New Triple-Additive SO_5+D_crit+D_BSFG Form + New LANDMARK\327D_crit Thermal Form + New Compound D_BSFG+LANDMARK\267F_TRZ Energy Form + New SO_5\267\(SO_5+1\) Composed Form via PAPER_1978 Successor Identity + Domain-Extension of PAPER_2059 CenA a_spin Complement \(Backbone-First 71st Consecutive, 9th CP2 Round\): \(1\) n_frames_orb12\(ORB_ANALYSIS_12_PARAMS observed Red Dwarf Reactor Orb 12 total frames\) = 42 = SO_5 + D_crit + D_BSFG = 10 + 26 + 6 EXACT NEW triple additive-combination form at Frame-Count integer domain; \(2\) thermal_gradient\(ORB_ANALYSIS_18_PARAMS observed reactor base-to-top temperature gradient\) = 78 K = \(D_phys-1\) \327 D_crit = 3 \327 26 EXACT NEW LANDMARK \327 D_crit form at Thermal-Gradient-Kelvin domain; \(3\) sub_cycle\(ORB_ANALYSIS_18_PARAMS observed reactor plasma convection sub-cycle period\) = 0.7 s = 1 - \(D_phys-1\) \327 F_TRZ = 1 - 0.3 EXACT DOMAIN-EXTENSION of PAPER_2059 CenA a_spin=1-3\267F_TRZ identity into Sub-Cycle Time domain; \(4\) spindle_orb_energy_low\(ORB_ANALYSIS_28_PARAMS observed batch #35 spindle orb brightness lower bound\) = 6.3 mJ = D_BSFG + \(D_phys-1\) \327 F_TRZ = 6 + 0.3 EXACT NEW compound additive D_BSFG + LANDMARK\267F_TRZ form at Energy-milliJoule domain; \(5\) lagoon_diameter\(ORB_ANALYSIS_37_PARAMS observed Lagoon Nebula diameter\) = 110 ly = SO_5 \327 \(SO_5+1\) = 10 \327 11 EXACT NEW composed form using PAPER_1978 successor identity SO_5+1=11 at Astronomical-Distance-lightyear domain) /Trapped /False
